[Cheats/Enable Test Menu in Main Menu Select Continue This menu allows you to view all of the images in-game, play all of the SFX, test controller vibration options, unlock everything and select any of the game's events]From the beginning	Starts the game normally. Scenario Sends you to a list of story related scenes to choose from. Character Allows you to view all of the character portraits. Many appear to be from another game BG	Allows you to view all of the background images. Event Allows you to view all of the event images in the game. BGM	Doesn't work. SE	Goes through all of the SFX in the game. Effect	Doesn't work. Movie This game has no movies.Route Check	Same as the Scenario option. System Flag	Unlock everything] 
